{"id":"quien","lemma":"quien","pos":"pron","rank":186,"glosses":["who","whom","whoever; whomever; anyone who"],"ipa":"/ˈkjen/","forms":{"plural":"quienes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-quien.wav","examples":[{"text":"Invita a quien quieras.","en":"Invite whoever you like.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534425"},{"text":"¿Quienes son esos hombres?","en":"Who are these men?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800264"},{"text":"Baila con quien quieras.","en":"Dance with whoever you want.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353096"},{"text":"¿Sabes quienes son ellos?","en":"Do you know who they are?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553887"},{"text":"Quien llegue primero, ganará.","en":"Whoever gets there first, wins.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/424991"}]}